{
  "meta": {
    "name": "app_automation_workflow",
    "title": "App 自动化决策流程",
    "description": "从钉钉打卡自动化中提取的通用决策模式。任何'自动操作App X'的任务都应走这个流程：先检查API可用性→无API则检查急速模式→仍不行则模拟点击→都不行则人工介入。避免在错误方向上探索。",
    "category": "task_management",
    "icon": "workflow",
    "tags": [
      "automation",
      "decision-tree",
      "app",
      "android"
    ],
    "expected_inputs": {
      "app_name": "string",
      "task_description": "string"
    },
    "expected_outputs": {
      "solution_type": "string",
      "deliverable": "string"
    },
    "author": "platform",
    "version": 1,
    "min_blocks_required": [
      "llm",
      "if_else",
      "template_transform"
    ],
    "provenance": [
      {
        "source_type": "expert_manual",
        "identifier": "platform:app_automation_workflow.json",
        "created_at": "2026-06-26T00:00:00Z",
        "user_id": null
      }
    ],
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "seed_template": true,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "rating_sum": 0,
    "rating_count": 0
  },
  "workflow": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "start",
        "type": "start",
        "title": "自动化需求",
        "config": {
          "inputs": [
            {
              "name": "app_name",
              "label": "App名称",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "task_description",
              "label": "任务描述",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "api_check",
        "type": "llm",
        "title": "检查 API 可用性",
        "config": {
          "system": "Check if the app has a public API for the task. Search for: official API docs, developer platform, third-party integrations. Answer YES, NO, or LIMITED with explanation.",
          "prompt": "App: {{ app_name }}\nTask: {{ task_description }}\n\nDoes this app have a public API that can accomplish this task? Answer with analysis.",
          "variables": {
            "app_name": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "start",
                "path": [
                  "app_name"
                ]
              }
            },
            "task_description": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "start",
                "path": [
                  "task_description"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "api_router",
        "type": "if_else",
        "title": "API 可用?",
        "config": {
          "cases": [
            {
              "id": "yes",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "$ref": {
                      "node_id": "api_check",
                      "path": [
                        "text"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "operator": "contains",
                  "expected": "YES"
                }
              ],
              "logical_operator": "and"
            },
            {
              "id": "limited",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "$ref": {
                      "node_id": "api_check",
                      "path": [
                        "text"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "operator": "contains",
                  "expected": "LIMITED"
                }
              ],
              "logical_operator": "and"
            }
          ],
          "default_branch": "no"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "use_api",
        "type": "template_transform",
        "title": "方案A: API 直接调用",
        "config": {
          "template": "# 方案A: 使用官方 API\n\n## 可行性分析\n{{ analysis }}\n\n## 实现方式\n1. 获取 API 凭证 (AppKey/AppSecret)\n2. 通过 HTTP Request 积木调用\n3. 配置 schedule_trigger 定时触发\n\n## Lilies 工作流\n使用 http_request + schedule_trigger 积木即可完成。",
          "variables": {
            "analysis": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "api_check",
                "path": [
                  "text"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "quick_mode_check",
        "type": "llm",
        "title": "检查急速/自动模式",
        "config": {
          "system": "Check if the app has a quick/auto mode (急速打卡, 自动签到, etc.) that triggers automatically when the app is opened. Search the app's settings or online docs. Answer YES or NO.",
          "prompt": "App: {{ app_name }}\n\nDoes this app have a 'quick mode' or 'auto mode' that triggers just by opening the app?\nFor example: DingTalk quick punch (急速打卡), WeChat auto sign-in, etc.\nAnswer YES or NO with explanation.",
          "variables": {
            "app_name": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "start",
                "path": [
                  "app_name"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "quick_router",
        "type": "if_else",
        "title": "急速模式?",
        "config": {
          "cases": [
            {
              "id": "yes",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "$ref": {
                      "node_id": "quick_mode_check",
                      "path": [
                        "text"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "operator": "contains",
                  "expected": "YES"
                }
              ],
              "logical_operator": "and"
            }
          ],
          "default_branch": "no"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "use_quick_mode",
        "type": "template_transform",
        "title": "方案B: 急速模式 + 启动App",
        "config": {
          "template": "# 方案B: 急速模式 (推荐)\n\n{{ analysis }}\n\n## 实现方式\n仅需: 定时启动 App → App 自动完成操作\n- Android: Termux + crontab + am start\n- 无需 API、无需坐标、无需点击\n\n## 复杂度: 极低\n一个 50 行 shell 脚本即可完成。",
          "variables": {
            "analysis": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "quick_mode_check",
                "path": [
                  "text"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "click_check",
        "type": "llm",
        "title": "检查模拟点击可行性",
        "config": {
          "system": "Evaluate if the task can be done via simulated taps. Consider: screen coordinates stability, UI changes, anti-automation detection. Answer FEASIBLE or NOT_FEASIBLE.",
          "prompt": "App: {{ app_name }}\nTask: {{ task_description }}\n\nCan this be done via simulated screen taps (input tap)?\nConsider coordinate stability, app updates, detection risk.",
          "variables": {
            "app_name": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "start",
                "path": [
                  "app_name"
                ]
              }
            },
            "task_description": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "start",
                "path": [
                  "task_description"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "click_router",
        "type": "if_else",
        "title": "点击可行?",
        "config": {
          "cases": [
            {
              "id": "yes",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "value": {
                    "$ref": {
                      "node_id": "click_check",
                      "path": [
                        "text"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "operator": "contains",
                  "expected": "FEASIBLE"
                }
              ],
              "logical_operator": "and"
            }
          ],
          "default_branch": "no"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "use_clicks",
        "type": "template_transform",
        "title": "方案C: 模拟点击",
        "config": {
          "template": "# 方案C: 模拟点击 (备选)\n\n{{ analysis }}\n\n## 注意\n- 坐标需校准\n- App 更新可能改变 UI 布局\n- 钉钉/企业微信等有反自动化检测\n\n## 实现方式\n- Android: Termux + input tap\n- 需记录屏幕坐标",
          "variables": {
            "analysis": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "click_check",
                "path": [
                  "text"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fallback",
        "type": "template_transform",
        "title": "方案D: 人工/待定",
        "config": {
          "template": "# 无法自动化\n\n{{ analysis }}\n\n该 App 的「{{ task }}」目前无法可靠地自动化。\n建议: 设置定时提醒，人工完成。\n\n等待 App 开放 API 或增加自动模式后再尝试。",
          "variables": {
            "analysis": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "click_check",
                "path": [
                  "text"
                ]
              }
            },
            "task": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "start",
                "path": [
                  "task_description"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "end",
        "type": "end",
        "title": "方案输出",
        "config": {
          "outputs": {
            "solution_type": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "agg",
                "path": [
                  "output",
                  "branch"
                ]
              }
            },
            "deliverable": {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "agg",
                "path": [
                  "output"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 2080,
          "y": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "agg",
        "type": "variable_aggregator",
        "title": "聚合结果",
        "config": {
          "variables": [
            {
              "$ref": {
                "node_id": "use_api",
                "path": [
                  "text"
                ],
                "optional": true
              }
            },
            {
